# Shared element model of results_static/ and results_dynamics/ (INCLUDEd by
# their decks). Units: mm, N, tonne, s.  Each region is a small cantilever
# clamped at x = 0 (SPC set 1), placed at y = 100 * region so that no two
# regions touch.  Load set 1: tip loads; load set 2: pressures and gravity. No
# region is a mechanism: the grid points that only carry one component have
# the others in GRID PS.
#
# Materials: an aluminium (MAT1, with stress allowables for the margins) and a
# carbon ply (MAT8, with strengths so that the failure indices and the
# strength ratios are computed).
